# agent-change-control kit manifest — what `install.sh --into <repo>` copies into a task repo.
# init    = copied only when missing in the target, never touched afterwards (the project owns it)
# managed = kept in sync; a target that was edited locally is kept unless --force
# map     = directory copied recursively (managed), source -> destination
# Columns: mode source [destination] [@github|@ado]. The destination defaults to the source path.
# The optional last column limits an entry to targets on that forge; no column = every forge.
# install.sh --forge github|ado picks the forge; default: ado when the target's origin is on
# dev.azure.com or *.visualstudio.com, else github. .github/hooks and .github/instructions carry
# no column: Copilot reads them on either forge.
init    AGENTS.md
init    CLAUDE.md
init    .claude/settings.json
init    .claude/guard.json
managed .github/hooks/guard.json
managed tools/guard/guard.py
managed tools/tracker/tracker.py
managed tools/tracker/ado.py
managed tools/tracker/label_lint.py
managed tools/tracker/session_start.py
managed tools/tracker/evidence_export.py
managed tools/commit_msg.py
managed .githooks/commit-msg
managed tools/egress/egress_screen.py
managed tools/review/fresh_review.py
managed tools/review/prompt.md
managed bin/fresh-review
managed .github/instructions/review.instructions.md
managed tools/memory/memstore.py
managed tools/telemetry/ledger.py
managed tools/telemetry/prices.json
managed tools/testguard/check-test-tampering.sh
managed tools/testguard/testguard.py
managed tools/testguard/ado_pr_context.py
managed tools/scan/latest_tag.py
managed .github/workflows/label-lint.yml                                         @github
init    .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/task.yml                                          @github
init    .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug.yml                                           @github
init    .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/config.yml                                        @github
init    ci/azure-pipelines.yml             azure-pipelines.yml                   @ado
managed ci/azure-pipelines-label-lint.yml  azure-pipelines-label-lint.yml        @ado
map     agents  .claude/agents
map     skills  .claude/skills
